## Purpose
- Pin down the organization API contract for organizations, members, teams, roles/permissions, invitations, and import/export.

## Source of truth
- `services/team-hub-organization/team-hub-organization/Controllers/*.cs`
- `services/team-hub-organization/team-hub-organization/Configuration/Options/JwtOptions.cs`
- `services/team-hub-organization/team-hub-organization/.env.example`
- `services/team-hub-organization/team-hub-organization/Data/OrganizationDbContext.cs`

## Do
- Use base route `/api/organizations/v1` (API version `1.0`).
- Require JWT Bearer on all organization endpoints (`sub` claim = user id from auth).
- Authorization is local (membership + role permissions); JWT carries identity only.
- RBAC: permissions are org-scoped; roles attach permissions; members get one or more org roles via `organization_member_roles`. Effective permissions = union of assigned roles. No direct user→permission grants.
- System org roles seeded on create: `Owner`, `Admin`, `Member`. System team roles: `TeamLead`, `Member`.
- System permission catalog cloned per organization on create (immutable `Code`, `IsSystem=true`): `org.manage`, `org.members.manage`, `org.teams.manage`, `org.roles.manage`, `org.delete`, `team.manage`, `team.members.manage`. Custom permissions may be created per org.
- Keep these endpoints:

### Health / ops
  - `GET /health` -> `200` healthy / `503` unhealthy (PostgreSQL)

### Organization
  - `POST /api/organizations/v1` -> `201 Created` with `OrganizationResponse`; body: `name` (required), `slug` (optional), `description` (optional, max 500), `nip` (required, 10 digits), `address` (`country`, `city`, `postalCode` required); auto-generates unique `email` as `{sanitizedName}{4digits}@teamhub.local`; seeds org permissions + system roles + bindings; creator becomes Owner; `409 Conflict` on explicit slug conflict; auto-generated slug suffixes on name collision (`acme`, `acme-2`, ...)
  - `GET /api/organizations/v1` -> `200 OK` with organizations for current user (non-deleted)
  - `GET /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}` -> `200 OK` for members; `403 Forbidden` for non-members; `404 Not Found` when missing or soft-deleted
  - `GET /api/organizations/v1/by-slug/{slug}` -> same rules as by id
  - `PATCH /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}` -> `200 OK`; updates `name`, `description`, `nip`, and/or `address`; requires `org.manage`; slug and email unchanged
  - `PUT /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/avatar` -> `200 OK`; multipart field `file` (JPEG/PNG/WebP, max 2 MB); requires `org.manage`; stores blob path in DB; response `avatarUrl` is read-only SAS URL
  - `DELETE /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/avatar` -> `200 OK`; requires `org.manage`; removes blob and clears avatar
  - `DELETE /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}` -> `204 No Content` for Owner (`org.delete`); soft delete via `DeletedAt`
  - `POST /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/transfer-ownership` -> `200 OK`; body `{ newOwnerUserId }`; Owner only; moves Owner role to target; previous Owner keeps/gains Admin
  - `POST /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/leave` -> `204 No Content`; self-remove; Owner cannot leave without transfer (`409`)

### Members
  - `GET /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/members` -> `200 OK`; member-only; response includes `roles[]`; optional query `roleId`, `teamId` (AND); unknown/deleted team → empty list
  - `GET /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/members/{userId}` -> `200 OK`; membership + `roles[]` + teams
  - `POST /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/members` -> `201 Created`; body `{ userId, roleIds: guid[] }` (min 1); requires `org.members.manage`; cannot assign Owner unless actor is Owner
  - `PATCH /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/members/{userId}` -> `200 OK`; body `{ roleIds: guid[] }` replaces org role set; requires `org.members.manage`; cannot demote last Owner
  - `DELETE /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/members/{userId}` -> `204 No Content`; requires `org.members.manage`; cannot remove last Owner
  - `GET /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/members/{userId}/teams` -> `200 OK`; team memberships in org

### Import / Export
  - Requires `org.members.manage`. Blob storage required for start/download (`503` when not configured).
  - Import CSV columns: `email` and/or `username`, `org_roles` (`;`-separated org role names), optional `team`, `team_role`, `job_title`. Matches existing auth users only; missing users are row errors (partial success). Already-members upsert roles/teams.
  - `POST /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/imports/preview` -> `200 OK` with row validation (no writes); multipart `file`
  - `POST /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/imports` -> `202 Accepted` `{ jobId }`; async job; error CSV artifact for failed rows
  - `POST /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/exports` -> `202 Accepted` `{ jobId }`; body `{ format: csv|json, datasets: members|teams|roles|permissions|organization[] }`
  - `GET /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/import-export/jobs` -> `200 OK` paged history
  - `GET /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/import-export/jobs/{jobId}` -> `200 OK` status + counters + artifact flags
  - `GET /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/import-export/jobs/{jobId}/download?artifact=result|errors|source` -> `200 OK` `{ url }` SAS

### Teams
  - `GET /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/teams` -> `200 OK`; non-deleted
  - `POST /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/teams` -> `201 Created`; body `{ name, description? }`; requires `org.teams.manage`
  - `GET /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/teams/{teamId}` -> `200 OK`; includes `memberCount`
  - `PATCH /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/teams/{teamId}` -> `200 OK`; body `{ name?, description? }`; requires `org.teams.manage`
  - `DELETE /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/teams/{teamId}` -> `204 No Content`; soft delete; requires `org.teams.manage`
  - `PUT /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/teams/{teamId}/avatar` -> `200 OK`; same file rules as org avatar; requires `org.teams.manage`
  - `DELETE /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/teams/{teamId}/avatar` -> `200 OK`; requires `org.teams.manage`
  - `GET /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/teams/{teamId}/members` -> `200 OK`
  - `POST /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/teams/{teamId}/members` -> `201 Created`; body `{ userId, roleId, jobTitle? }`; user must be org member; requires `org.teams.manage`
  - `PATCH /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/teams/{teamId}/members/{userId}` -> `200 OK`; body `{ roleId?, jobTitle? }`; requires `org.teams.manage`
  - `DELETE /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/teams/{teamId}/members/{userId}` -> `204 No Content`; requires `org.teams.manage`

### Roles
  - `GET /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/roles` -> `200 OK`; query `?scope=ORG|TEAM` optional; includes `memberCount`, `permissionCount`; member-only
  - `POST /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/roles` -> `201 Created`; body `{ name, description?, scope }`; requires `org.roles.manage`; `409` on duplicate name/scope
  - `GET /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/roles/{roleId}` -> `200 OK`; detail with `members[]`, `permissions[]`, `memberCount`
  - `PATCH /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/roles/{roleId}` -> `200 OK`; body `{ name?, description? }`; cannot rename Owner; requires `org.roles.manage`
  - `DELETE /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/roles/{roleId}` -> `204 No Content`; blocked if system or in use (`409`); requires `org.roles.manage`
  - `GET /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/roles/{roleId}/permissions` -> `200 OK`; permission summaries
  - `PUT /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/roles/{roleId}/permissions` -> `200 OK`; replace set `{ permissionIds: guid[] }`; requires `org.roles.manage`; Owner role permissions immutable
  - `POST /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/roles/{roleId}/permissions` -> `200 OK`; add `{ permissionIds }` (idempotent); requires `org.roles.manage`
  - `DELETE /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/roles/{roleId}/permissions/{permissionId}` -> `204 No Content`; requires `org.roles.manage`
  - `GET /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/roles/{roleId}/members` -> `200 OK`; org members with this ORG role
  - `POST /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/roles/{roleId}/members` -> `201 Created`; body `{ userId }`; requires `org.members.manage`; `409` if already assigned
  - `DELETE /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/roles/{roleId}/members/{userId}` -> `204 No Content`; requires `org.members.manage`; cannot revoke last Owner

### Permissions
  - `GET /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/permissions` -> `200 OK`; org permissions + `roleCount`; member-only
  - `POST /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/permissions` -> `201 Created`; body `{ name, code, description? }`; custom only; code pattern `^[a-z][a-z0-9._-]*$`; requires `org.roles.manage`; `409` on duplicate code
  - `GET /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/permissions/{permissionId}` -> `200 OK`; detail with `roles[]`, `roleCount`
  - `PATCH /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/permissions/{permissionId}` -> `200 OK`; body `{ name?, description? }`; system: description only; code never changes; requires `org.roles.manage`
  - `DELETE /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/permissions/{permissionId}` -> `204 No Content`; blocked if system or assigned to roles (`409`); requires `org.roles.manage`

### Invitations
  - `GET /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/invitations` -> `200 OK`; query `?status=Pending` optional; requires `org.members.manage`
  - `POST /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/invitations` -> `201 Created`; body `{ email, orgRoleIds: guid[], teamId?, teamRoleId? }` (min 1 org role); requires `org.members.manage`
  - `GET /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/invitations/{invitationId}` -> `200 OK`; requires `org.members.manage`
  - `DELETE /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/invitations/{invitationId}` -> `204 No Content`; cancel Pending → Expired; requires `org.members.manage`
  - `POST /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/invitations/{invitationId}/resend` -> `200 OK`; new token + extended expiry; requires `org.members.manage`
  - `GET /api/organizations/v1/invitations/by-token/{token}` -> `200 OK`; JWT required; preview pending invite
  - `POST /api/organizations/v1/invitations/by-token/{token}/accept` -> `200 OK`; creates org member with all invite org roles (+ optional team member); JWT required
  - `POST /api/organizations/v1/invitations/by-token/{token}/reject` -> `200 OK`; JWT required

### Activity
  - `GET /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/activity` -> `200 OK`; member-only; paged feed newest-first
  - Query: `type?`, `q?` (matches type/details), `from?`, `to?`, `page` (default 1), `pageSize` (default 20, max 100)
  - Response: `{ items[], page, pageSize, totalCount }`
  - Item: `id`, `type`, `actorUserId?`, `targetUserId?`, `entityType?`, `entityId?`, `details?` (JSON snapshot), `occurredAt`
  - Types include: `MemberJoined`, `MemberLeft`, `MemberRolesChanged`, `InvitationSent`, `InvitationAccepted`, `InvitationRejected`, `InvitationExpired`, `InvitationResent`, `RoleCreated`, `RoleUpdated`, `RoleDeleted`, `RolePermissionsChanged`, `RoleMemberAssigned`, `RoleMemberRevoked`, `PermissionCreated`, `PermissionUpdated`, `PermissionDeleted`, `TeamCreated`, `TeamUpdated`, `TeamDeleted`, `TeamMemberAdded`, `TeamMemberUpdated`, `TeamMemberRemoved`, `OrganizationUpdated`, `OwnershipTransferred`, `OrganizationDeleted`
  - Written in-process from mutating services (append-only `organization_activities`); not a domain event bus

### Statistics
  - `GET /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/stats` -> `200 OK`; member-only
  - Response: `{ memberCount, teamCount }` (`teamCount` excludes soft-deleted teams)

### Current user
  - `GET /api/organizations/v1/{orgId}/me` -> `200 OK`; membership, `roles[]`, union of permission codes, teams
  - `GET /api/organizations/v1/me/invitations` -> `200 OK`; pending invites matching JWT email claim; empty when email claim absent

### Domain events (future — documented only; not emitted yet)
  - `RoleCreated` / `RoleUpdated` / `RoleDeleted` — `organizationId`, `roleId`, `name`, `scope`, `actorUserId`, `occurredAt`
  - `RolePermissionsChanged` — `organizationId`, `roleId`, `permissionIds`, `changeType` (`Added`|`Removed`|`Replaced`), `actorUserId`
  - `MemberRoleAssigned` / `MemberRoleRevoked` — `organizationId`, `roleId`, `userId`, `actorUserId`
  - `PermissionCreated` / `PermissionUpdated` / `PermissionDeleted` — `organizationId`, `permissionId`, `code`, `actorUserId`

- Avatar upload/delete returns `503` when `BlobStorage:ConnectionString` is not configured.
- Keep JWT: `Jwt:Issuer`/`Jwt:Audience` in appsettings; `Jwt__Key` from env (same key as auth).
- Keep PostgreSQL connection: `ConnectionStrings__DefaultConnection` in organization `.env`.
- Dev blob storage (Azurite): `BlobStorage__ConnectionString`, `BlobStorage__ContainerName`, `BlobStorage__PublicBlobEndpoint`, `BlobStorage__SasExpiryMinutes`.

## Don't
- Do not store user profiles here (auth owns users).
- Do not set `avatarUrl` via PATCH (use avatar upload endpoint).
- Do not introduce undocumented organization endpoints.
- Do not grant permissions directly to users (use roles).
- Do not delete or change `Code` on system permissions.
- Do not emit domain events until an event bus is introduced.

## Checklist
- Endpoint names and status codes match controller code/tests.
- Gateway route `/api/organizations/{**catch-all}` forwards to this service without path rewrite.
- JWT options are present before app start (`ValidateOnStart`).
